{"id":"regla","lemma":"regla","pos":"noun","rank":829,"glosses":["rule (regulation, norm)","ruler (measuring stick)","menstruation, period"],"ipa":"/ˈreɡla/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"reglas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-regla.wav","examples":[{"text":"La excepción confirma la regla.","en":"Exceptions prove the rule.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551727"},{"text":"Tom sabía las reglas.","en":"Tom knew the rules.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799964"},{"text":"Él me explicó la regla.","en":"He explained the rule to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1189470"},{"text":"Ustedes conocen las reglas.","en":"You know the rules.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449684"},{"text":"Esta regla no tiene excepciones.","en":"This rule has no exceptions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330763"}]}